//|                              XAUUSD_SinglePosition_v5.mq5        |
//|                                                                  |
//|  v5.00 - ONE POSITION AT A TIME, 1:3 REWARD, 5-STAGE TRAIL       |
//|   * One position, one layer. No pyramiding.                      |
//|   * SL = 200 pips, TP = 600 pips (broker-side).                  |
//|   * LOT SIZE                                                     |
//|        Strategy Tester / optimization : always 0.01              |
//|        Live / demo : 0.01 lot per 400 of balance                 |
//|            400 -> 0.01 | 800 -> 0.02 | 1200 -> 0.03 | ...        |
//|   * TRAIL (fractions of TP distance, from the entry price):      |
//|        reached 20% of TP -> SL to  1% of TP                      |
//|        reached 50% of TP -> SL to 20% of TP                      |
//|        reached 70% of TP -> SL to 50% of TP                      |
//|        reached 80% of TP -> SL to 60% of TP                      |
//|        reached 90% of TP -> SL to 80% of TP                      |
//|     SL only moves forward.                                       |
//|   * GOOGLE SHEET LIVE REPORT: a row is added when a position     |
//|     opens and completed when it closes (WebRequest -> Google     |
//|     Apps Script web app). Not sent inside the Strategy Tester.   |
//|   * Direction engine (EMA 5/20, hysteresis, confirm, stop-and-   |
//|     reverse) is unchanged from v4.06. Trades 24/7.               |
//+------------------------------------------------------------------+
